    504 DLX(I)*3.17098E-11   ! Conversion: kg/km2/year to g/m2/s 1000/(365*86400*1000*1000)=3.17098E-11; final unit g/s except for H
    504 g where it is ug/s
    505                             IF(ATMDCN(JAC,JW)==NPO4.OR.ATMDCN(JAC,JW)==NLPOMP.OR.ATMDCN(JAC,JW)==NRPOMP)THEN 
